            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Weft 1.1.24

- Keep the approved recipe available when refreshing a project, so pending reviews show a useful diff.
- Include changed preview and worktree settings in the review.
- Show the complete proposed recipe when an older approved copy is unavailable, instead of an empty review.

- Show one desktop preview for launch-enabled services and let it fill the available inspector space.
]]></description>
